  "question": {
    "text": "The normal to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> at <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> meets the parabola again at <math><mi>Q</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If the tangent at <math><mi>Q</mi></math> meets the directrix at <math><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the slope of another tangent drawn from point <math><mi>R</mi></math> to this parabola is",
    "image": null
  },
