  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Parameter corresponding to <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Hence, the parameter corresponding to <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the point where another tangent from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;touches the parabola<br />Now, if the tangent at <math><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> meet on the directrix at <math><mi>R</mi></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So the equation of the tangent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>121</mn></mfrac></math><br />&nbsp;Hence, the slope of the tangent at <math><mi>S</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
